fixture dash_out_of_hitstop
doc BUILD.md s6 Hit feedback, "Hitstop is never applied to the player's own input reading: the player can buffer through it"; s15 Combat, "Hitstop never causes a dropped input; buffered inputs fire on the first free frame". A dash pressed during side 1's hitstop fires on the first free frame, side 1's frame 4 (its dash cancel).
room test/dummy
frames 20
input
  0 attack
  3 dash
end
expect
  at 2 event.hit=1 freeze=2
  at 4 state=ground action=side1
  at 5 state=dash action=none
end
